<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major>ArcheAge AFK Ebonsong Mob Farm</Major>
    <Description>An AFK Macro for farming mobs on ArcheAge as an Ebonsong. 

Macro is tested and working perfectly in ArcheAge Legacy and ArcheAge Unchained. 

Instructions: 

On keybind 1: Endless Arrows 
On keybind 2: Health potion, pref. rank 6+ 
Optional, can add in a third keybind 3: Mana potion, pref. rank 6+ 

Recommended equipment: 

Minimum DPS of 1200 Ranged Attack for Aegis, WHM, Exeloch 
Minimum DPS of 1600 Ranged Attack for EHM

Macro consumes roughly 120 health potions per hour of use, assuming potions are rank 6+ and on a 30 second cooldown. 

Macro consumes roughly 120 mana potions per hour of use, assuming potions are rank 6+ and on a 30 second cooldown. (If using a mana potion keybind) 

Average return on the macro as tested in WHM is roughly 1,800 gold per hour of use. 

It is recommended that the macro be checked every hour or every two hours, I routinely use it without issue. </Description>
    <Comment>https://botmek.com - Free macros download | Скачать бесплатные макросы </Comment>
